        "scope": "The paid, multi-graph workspace: open instances, their positions/sizes, and camera state. Not graph content, which is always refetched fresh, and not focus, which is always re-derived rather than restored.",
        "notes": "Reviewed live on 2026-09-22 after several restore-related bugs surfaced during testing.",
